"settings.resetDefault" = "Reset to Default";
"settings.promptCaption" = "Utterances are sent wrapped in a <u> tag whose source/target attributes carry the translation direction as BCP-47 codes. When customizing, keep the premise of translating into the target attribute's language — one prompt then serves both the one-direction and bidirectional modes — and keep the convention that utterances arrive wrapped in <u>...</u> tags (without it, the model replies conversationally instead of translating). Takes effect from the next Start.";
